<title>EGYPT: Middle East economic conference closes.</title>
<headline>Middle East economic conference closes.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Middle East economic conference closed in Cairo on Thursday after three days of talk on regional cooperation and contacts between more than 1,500 businessmen.</p>
</text>
